OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be   
OL,6,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain,         
OL,7,Fbecoming heavy at times and            
OL,8,Faccompanied by strong southeasterly    
OL,9,Fwinds. Western areas will turn drier   
OL,10,Fand less windy later.                  
OL,12,CTuesday:FA wet windy start in the east 
OL,13,Fbefore drier conditions with lighter   
OL,14,Fwinds gradually spread across from the 
OL,15,Fwest.                                  
OL,17,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,18,Fwith outbreaks of rain, becoming heavy 
OL,19,Fat times and accompanied by strong     
OL,20,Fsoutheasterly winds. Western areas     
OL,21,Fwill turn drier and less windy later.  
